config VIDEO_RPI_DW9807_VCM
	tristate "DW9807/DW9817 lens voice coil support (Raspberry Pi driver)"
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
	select V4L2_ASYNC
	help
	  Raspberry Pi's driver for the Dongwoon DW9807 and DW9817 voice coil
	  lens drivers: the focus motors of the Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3
	  and the Arducam 64 MP module. Focus is set with the
	  V4L2_CID_FOCUS_ABSOLUTE control on the lens sub-device.

	  The module is called rpi_dw9807_vcm.
